  PAW_HELP_TEXTS: array[0..PAW_HELP_COUNT - 1] of string = (
    'ABILITY value1 value2' +
      LineEnding +
      'This sets Flag 37, the maximum number of objects conveyable, to value1 and Flag 52, the maximum weight of objects the player may carry and wear at any one time (or their strength), to be value2. No ch' +
      'ecks are made to ensure that the player is not already carrying more than the maximum. GET and so on, which check the values, will still work correctly and prevent the player carrying any more objects' +
