      'd.',
    'BACKAT' +
      LineEnding +
      'Flushes the current wordwrap buffer thus restoring the current background colours. Then restores the print position last saved by SAVEAT.',
    'BEEP duration pitch' +
      LineEnding +
      'Both duration and pitch may range from 0 to 255. Duration is in units of one hundredth of a second. The value of itch is obtained by taking the value you would use in a BASIC BEEP command, adding 60 t' +
