      LineEnding +
      '2 - The object number is converted into the LS Nound1 (and Adjective1 if present) by reference to the object word table. If Noun (Adjective)1 matches Noun (Adjective)2 then a return is made to step 1.' +
      ' This implements the "Verb ALL EXCEPT object" facility of the parser.' +
      LineEnding +
      '3 - The next condact and / or entry in the table is then considered. This effectively converts a phrase of "Verb All" into "Verb object" which is then processed by the table as if the player had typed' +
